   "title": "未设table-tr致表格分页遭弹窗裁切",
   "type": "bug",
   "content": "zs-table 未设 table-tr 默认按约10行渲染，超弹窗高度致分页被 overflow:hidden 裁切。ScopeSelectDialog.vue 用 scope-select-table-wrap 包裹并绑 :table-tr=\"listTableTr\"，通过 ResizeObserver 动态计算行高，表格区 flex:1; min-height:0，搜索与分页 flex-shrink:0 确保可见。",
